  `row_selfconsistent' stops at 65,535 by design and its comment promised 'its own round' that was never filed"*; its
  note opens *"FILE, LOW (a degenerate override or a >= 31.5 GiB IDE image; word 49 advertises no LBA so the CHS words are
  the guest's only capacity)."*
* `wdcaltoffset` (closed, commits `3521a22 c125450`) -- *"wdc alt-ctrl: a guest write to the READ-ONLY Drive Address
