1610| 		 *  Multi-track (CUE/BIN) CD-ROM images use the parsed track
1611| 		 *  table to map logical offsets to the right bin file and
1612| 		 *  sector; all other (flat file) images use the unchanged
1613| 		 *  code paths below.
1614| 		 */
1615| 		/*
