1634| 	 *  READS may legitimately come up short and still succeed: the
1635| 	 *  advertised capacity is rounded up to whole cylinders, so the last
1636| 	 *  480..992 blocks of every image in this project are addressable but
1637| 	 *  not backed by file.  Those reads are zero-filled above and stay
1638| 	 *  GOOD -- that is the behaviour the rig images have relied on for the
