1494|     #  *** PARSE BEFORE SCORE -- the same guard the wdcflood section above carries,
1495|     #  and for the same measured reason: a result line that EXISTS but is MALFORMED
1496|     #  still satisfies the outer grep, `adres' is then EMPTY, and both ${adres%/*}
